CLASS com/corrodinggames/rts/game/units/custom/j com/corrodinggames/rts/game/units/custom/CustomUnit
	FIELD a animFrameIndex I
		COMMENT Index of the currently displayed sprite frame within the (possibly animated) body image. Written by AnimationPlaying.applyBlend from AnimationKeyFrameType.frame keyframes and reset to meta.default_frame, and by applyMetadata when the unit configuration is (re)applied. Read by getSpriteFrameRect(boolean) to pick the source Rect, by DecalManager.a(...) when spawning decals, and by BattleInterface.getUnitInfoStatsText for the unit info readout.
	FIELD A savedUnitDataFields [Lcom/corrodinggames/rts/game/units/custom/at;
	FIELD b animationPlayer Lcom/corrodinggames/rts/game/units/custom/e;
	FIELD B transportedUnits Lcom/corrodinggames/rts/gameFramework/utility/m;
	FIELD c animScale F
		COMMENT Body sprite scale driven by the running animation, initialised to 1.0F. Written only by AnimationPlaying.applyBlend, where the AnimationKeyFrameType.scale branch assigns the evaluated keyframe value (or 1.0F on reset), and by AnimationPlaying.setBaseBlendValues, which snapshots it as the blend base value for scale tracks. Read by getBodyDrawScale(), which multiplies it with meta.bH (the static [graphics]scaleImagesTo / imageScale factor) to produce the final body draw scale.
	FIELD C attachedUnits Lcom/corrodinggames/rts/gameFramework/utility/m;
