	METHOD dB resetLegStates ()V
		COMMENT Resets every leg to its neutral resting pose and clears any pending leg action. Iterates legStates and raises both the deforming (n) and moved (m) flags on each LegState so the next leg update recomputes them, then calls clearLegAction(). Sole caller is startSlowDeathFall, which wants the legs to snap back before the wreck begins toppling.
	METHOD dC getUpgradeActions ()Ljava/util/ArrayList;
	METHOD dD clearUnitEventQueue ()V
