	METHOD du initLegs ()V
	METHOD dv clearLegAction ()V
		COMMENT Clears the currently applied leg action by running the leg action hook with a zero amount, which returns every leg track to its base value. Called from resetLegStates so the legs are fully neutral before a wreck topples. Companion of the leg animation machinery driven through meta.legTemplates / LegState.
